WEBVTT

00:00:15.917 --> 00:00:18.042
"Chief of the Mountain Goblins Kosogi"

00:00:18.875 --> 00:00:21.042
"Chief of the Flatland Goblins Shibori"

00:00:21.958 --> 00:00:24.000
"Chief of the Orcs Lilpilin"

00:00:24.792 --> 00:00:27.042
"Chief of the Giants Sigurosig"

00:00:27.833 --> 00:00:30.042
"Chief of the Ogres Furgr"

00:00:30.458 --> 00:00:33.125
"Tenth Champion of the Pugilists Guild Iskahn"

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.125
"Chancellor of the Dark Mages Guild Dee Eye Ell"

00:00:36.958 --> 00:00:39.000
"Dark Knight Vassago"

00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:43.292
"Dark God Vecta"

00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:49.000
"First Unit, Right Flank
Integrity Knight Deusolbert Synthesis Seven"

00:00:49.833 --> 00:00:52.333
"First Unit, Center
Integrity Knight Fanatio Synthesis Two"

00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:55.792
"First Unit, Left Flank
Integrity Knight Eldrie Synthesis Thirty-One"

00:00:56.292 --> 00:00:59.167
"Second Unit, Right Flank
Integrity Knight Sheyta Synthesis Twelve"

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:02.667
"Second Unit, Right Flank
Integrity Knight Renly Synthesis Twenty-Seven"

00:01:04.625 --> 00:01:07.542
"Second Unit, Center
Integrity Knight Bercouli Synthesis One"

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:14.417
"Integrity Knight Alice Synthesis Thirty"

00:01:29.667 --> 00:01:33.042
"November 7, 380 HE The Eastern Gate"

00:01:44.167 --> 00:01:46.500
The final load test, huh?

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:49.667
This puts even Hollywood movies to shame!

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:54.292
Maybe we should grab this video
technology instead of the AI, bro.

00:01:54.292 --> 00:01:59.750
All we have to do is start a VFX studio
and we'd immediately be billionaires!

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:04.750
Sorry, but the visuals we're seeing now
can't be written to any media.

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:07.875
Since the things in this world
aren't made up of polygons.

00:02:07.875 --> 00:02:13.125
It's an extravagant show that can only
be seen by those connected to the STL.

00:02:24.833 --> 00:02:27.333
Soldiers of the land of darkness!

00:02:27.333 --> 00:02:30.208
The time you have long awaited is nigh!

00:02:30.208 --> 00:02:32.750
Kill all living things!

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:35.625
Pillage all that you can!

00:02:35.625 --> 00:02:37.625
Lay waste to this land!

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:48.917
First group! Begin the assault!

00:02:49.542 --> 00:02:51.917
"Dark Territory Army First Group
Flatland Goblin Unit"

00:02:52.042 --> 00:02:54.292
Kill them! Kill them!

00:02:55.333 --> 00:02:58.417
"Dark Territory Army First Group Giant Unit"

00:02:59.292 --> 00:03:01.083
Crush them!

00:03:01.208 --> 00:03:04.458
"Dark Territory Army First Group
Mountain Goblin Unit"

00:03:05.250 --> 00:03:08.125
Charge!

00:03:09.458 --> 00:03:12.083
"Dark Territory Army Rear Guard"

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.667
"Human Guardian Army
First Unit, Center"

00:03:28.667 --> 00:03:30.833
"Human Guardian Army
First Unit, Center"
First unit, draw your swords!

00:03:30.833 --> 00:03:32.375
Prepare for battle!

00:03:34.542 --> 00:03:38.958
Monk unit, prepare your
healing arts and incantations!

00:03:38.958 --> 00:03:43.208
System Call. Generate Luminous Element.

00:03:43.208 --> 00:03:44.375
"Human Guardian Army
First Unit, Right Flank"

00:03:44.375 --> 00:03:46.958
"Human Guardian Army
First Unit, Right Flank"
They're coming.

00:03:46.958 --> 00:03:50.083
"Human Guardian Army
First Unit, Left Flank"
You cursed dwellers of the darkness.

00:03:50.083 --> 00:03:52.625
"Human Guardian Army
First Unit, Left Flank"
We'll show you what we're made of!

00:03:52.625 --> 00:03:56.000
"Human Guardian Army
Second Unit, Left Flank"

00:03:56.583 --> 00:03:59.958
"Human Guardian Army
Second Unit, Left Flank"

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:04.375
"Human Guardian Army
Second Unit, Center"

00:04:13.708 --> 00:04:15.875
"Human Guardian Army
The skies above"

00:04:17.792 --> 00:04:19.417
It's begun.

00:04:26.083 --> 00:04:30.667
I shall... do what I must.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:06.000
"Battle of the Knights"

00:06:09.542 --> 00:06:12.708
"Human Guardian Army
First Unit, Right Flank"

00:06:24.417 --> 00:06:26.208
Wake up, dear.

00:06:30.708 --> 00:06:33.000
It's morning.

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:36.833
The one memory from
my past that I have left.

00:06:38.458 --> 00:06:42.458
I don't even know when it occurred. But...

00:06:43.750 --> 00:06:50.625
...in order to protect the world
in which she lived with me...

00:06:51.625 --> 00:06:54.625
Enhance Armament!

00:07:13.083 --> 00:07:16.708
I am Integrity Knight Deusolbert
Synthesis Seven!

00:07:16.708 --> 00:07:21.917
Those who stand before me, you shall
burn so not even your bones remain!

00:08:03.375 --> 00:08:06.625
"Human Guardian
Army First Unit, Center"

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:14.625
First, we're going to restore the decimated
Order of the Integrity Knights.

00:08:14.625 --> 00:08:18.500
Next, we'll rebuild the Imperial Knights
of the four empires.

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:24.208
They'll need to be retrained. Since there's
not nearly enough Integrity Knights.

00:08:24.208 --> 00:08:26.792
I'm sure some of you are unhappy about this,

00:08:26.792 --> 00:08:29.375
but right now, saving the
people is our top priority.

00:08:29.375 --> 00:08:31.833
I ask that you lend me your strength.

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:37.167
My lord, I shall follow you wherever you go.

00:08:43.333 --> 00:08:44.625
Found him.

00:08:45.583 --> 00:08:48.250
Enhance Armament!

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:50.667
Pierce... O Light!

00:09:09.250 --> 00:09:11.917
"Human Empire Army
Second Unit, Right Flank"

00:09:12.542 --> 00:09:15.125
Oh, it's started, huh?

00:09:15.125 --> 00:09:16.292
It has.

00:09:16.292 --> 00:09:19.667
It looks like Uncle Deusolbert
is doing his best.

00:09:19.667 --> 00:09:22.542
The vice commander seems to be doing well, too.

00:09:22.542 --> 00:09:23.708
But...

00:09:23.708 --> 00:09:26.958
The left flank doesn't look so good, does it?

00:09:28.167 --> 00:09:34.250
The first unit's Eldrie is definitely skillful,
but as a knight, he's still a novice.

00:09:34.250 --> 00:09:38.750
And behind him, there's Renlicchi,
who isn't very dependable.

00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:42.750
The Supply Corps is behind
the left flank, isn't it?

00:09:42.750 --> 00:09:46.542
Along with that rebel, Kirito, right?

00:09:53.833 --> 00:09:57.625
Everyone! Stay together and follow my lead!

00:09:58.125 --> 00:10:00.792
"Human Guardian Army
First Unit, Left Flank"

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:04.250
Don't let a single one get past us!

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:05.500
Engage the enemy!

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:06.875
Sir!

00:10:11.167 --> 00:10:12.042
What's that?

00:10:12.042 --> 00:10:14.083
Now! Throw them!

00:10:22.750 --> 00:10:24.000
This is--

00:10:27.083 --> 00:10:29.917
Everyone! Run!

00:10:32.625 --> 00:10:33.917
--I won't let--
--Wait!

00:10:33.917 --> 00:10:36.750
If we swing our swords now,
we'll end up hitting each other!

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:43.625
We have to let Sir Renly in the second unit
behind us know what's happening!

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:47.667
"Human Guardian Army
Second Unit, Center"

00:10:50.125 --> 00:10:52.042
It seems there's been a disaster
on the front lines!

00:10:52.042 --> 00:10:57.042
The Integrity Knight... Where is Sir Renly?

00:10:57.042 --> 00:10:58.667
The thing is...

00:10:58.667 --> 00:11:01.833
...he's nowhere to be found!

00:11:08.458 --> 00:11:11.500
"Human Guardian Army
First Unit, Right Flank"

00:11:18.958 --> 00:11:22.125
Everyone! Kill that archer!

00:11:22.125 --> 00:11:25.292
Surround him, carve him up,
and pummel him into oblivion!

00:11:38.417 --> 00:11:39.958
Protect Sir Knight!

00:11:39.958 --> 00:11:42.000
Don't let their blades touch him!

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:44.458
Sorry. I'm counting on you!

00:11:44.458 --> 00:11:46.333
Leave this to us!

00:12:27.417 --> 00:12:33.417
To think that a mere human
would cause such fear in me.

00:12:33.417 --> 00:12:37.042
It can't be.

00:12:37.042 --> 00:12:39.417
It can't be. It can't be.

00:12:39.417 --> 00:12:41.750
It can't be. It can't be. It can't be.

00:12:41.750 --> 00:12:43.625
Kill. Kill.

00:12:43.625 --> 00:12:46.417
Kill. Kill. Ki--

00:12:59.583 --> 00:13:01.875
Kill! Ki--

00:13:08.542 --> 00:13:09.875
I can't move!

00:13:13.125 --> 00:13:14.333
Why?

00:13:14.333 --> 00:13:19.000
Kill human!

00:13:27.125 --> 00:13:29.250
My lord...

00:13:29.250 --> 00:13:30.667
Lady Fanatio!

00:13:33.208 --> 00:13:34.500
Dakira?

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:06.667
Dakira!

00:14:14.042 --> 00:14:15.958
Dakira!

00:14:15.958 --> 00:14:17.625
Don't die!

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:23.458
I'll see to your wounds right now!

00:14:27.542 --> 00:14:31.375
Lady... Fanatio.

00:14:31.375 --> 00:14:33.375
I shall...

00:14:34.417 --> 00:14:37.625
...adore you...

00:14:41.958 --> 00:14:43.458
...forev...

00:14:44.708 --> 00:14:46.083
...er.

00:14:55.917 --> 00:14:58.583
We must protect Lady Fanatio!

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:05.375
I won't forgive you!

00:15:36.542 --> 00:15:40.542
Kill human!

00:15:40.542 --> 00:15:42.750
Return to the bowels of the earth!

00:16:15.250 --> 00:16:18.500
First unit, center, advance!

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:20.583
Push the enemy back!

00:16:23.625 --> 00:16:26.583
"Human Guardian Army
First Unit, Right Flank"

00:16:37.792 --> 00:16:40.833
So this is what war is.

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:45.250
How long has it been since the battle began?

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:58.625
Not yet? No order to retreat yet?

00:17:02.042 --> 00:17:04.208
All right, then.

00:17:04.208 --> 00:17:07.500
So you've finally run out of arrows, huh?

00:17:18.333 --> 00:17:23.042
Are you one of the dark empire's
Council of Ten? A goblin chief?

00:17:23.042 --> 00:17:28.125
That's right. I'm the chief of the
flatland goblins, Lord Shibori!

00:17:30.833 --> 00:17:34.708
I am Integrity Knight Deusolbert
Synthesis Seven.

00:17:34.708 --> 00:17:39.792
Whoa! Like I care about some Ium's name!

00:17:39.792 --> 00:17:41.500
You're just meat to me!

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:45.417
The annoying piece of meat attached
to the head I'm about to take!

00:17:45.417 --> 00:17:48.542
All right, everyone, get him!

00:17:49.875 --> 00:17:51.583
How absurd!

00:18:02.208 --> 00:18:03.875
Four left.

00:18:25.833 --> 00:18:29.667
Sir Knight!

00:18:59.833 --> 00:19:01.583
O Flames!

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:20.458
Burn to ash!

00:19:46.792 --> 00:19:50.167
"Human Guardian Army
Second Unit, Center"

00:19:52.167 --> 00:19:53.458
Reporting.

00:19:53.458 --> 00:19:56.083
Lady Fanatio faced the giant chief,

00:19:56.083 --> 00:19:58.875
and Sir Deusolbert faced
the flatland goblin chief,

00:19:58.875 --> 00:20:01.792
and they've defeated them both.

00:20:01.792 --> 00:20:03.917
I see.

00:20:03.917 --> 00:20:08.875
That said, we are still overwhelmingly
outnumbered by the enemy forces.

00:20:08.875 --> 00:20:12.542
It's only a matter of time before
the battle lines for each unit collapse.

00:20:12.542 --> 00:20:15.250
What about the enemy's aerial forces?

00:20:15.250 --> 00:20:19.292
So far, there's no sign of
their flying dragons or minions.

00:21:10.333 --> 00:21:12.042
It's all right.

00:21:54.208 --> 00:21:58.125
"Human Guardian Army Supply Corps
Supply Storage Tents"

00:23:48.292 --> 00:23:52.107
Next time: "Stigma of the Disqualified."
